案例 3：统计字符出现次数
java 复制代码 public static int countChar ( String s , char target ) { int count = 0 ; for ( int i = 0 ; i < s . length (); i ++ ) { if ( s . charAt ( i ) == target ) count ++ ; } return count ; }

